# jsDelivr Scripts — Footer Only (CRITICAL)

**NEVER** move, relocate, or convert jsDelivr `<script>` links or `<script type="importmap">` blocks out of the **Before `</body>`** (footer) custom code into the **`<head>`** tag.

All jsDelivr scripts **MUST** remain permanently inside the **Before `</body>`** tag.

**Updating is allowed.** Swapping the commit pin, `src` URL, or SRI hash in an existing footer script is normal and expected. Do that in place — in the footer — after pushing JS changes to GitHub.

**What is forbidden:** moving scripts to `<head>`, deleting footer jsDelivr tags without replacing them in the footer, or “consolidating” scripts into head for performance.

## Allowed updates (footer only)

```html
<!-- ✅ OK — update commit pin in footer after a JS push -->
<script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Staylow-flow/lowtideflow-assets@1142f69/js/ltf.js"></script>
<!-- becomes -->
<script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Staylow-flow/lowtideflow-assets@cabd203/js/ltf.js"></script>
```

- Change `@<commit>` to ship new JS
- Add, remove, or swap footer script tags **as long as they stay in Before `</body>`**
- Update importmap URLs in the footer when needed

## Forbidden

```html
<!-- ❌ NEVER in <head> -->
<!-- ❌ NEVER delete footer jsDelivr tags without replacing them in the footer -->
<script type="importmap">…</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Staylow-flow/lowtideflow-assets@…/js/ltf.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/…"></script>
```

## Required

```html
<!-- ✅ ONLY in Before </body> (footer custom code) -->
<script type="importmap">…</script>
<script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Staylow-flow/lowtideflow-assets@<commit>/js/ltf.js"></script>
```

## Head vs footer split

| Location | Allowed |
|----------|---------|
| **`<head>`** | CSS (`<style>`), `:root` tokens, `@keyframes`, layout cages — **no jsDelivr scripts, no importmaps** |
| **Before `</body>`** | All jsDelivr `<script>` tags, importmaps, module entry points |

When deploying via Webflow MCP, use `location: "footer"` for any jsDelivr or importmap content. Never use `location: "head"` for scripts.
